# Cloudflare Pages Caching Headers for X440 Garage PWA

# 1. Service Worker & Manifest: Never cache permanently so users get instant PWA updates
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json; charset=utf-8

/registerSW.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# 2. Immutable assets: Vite generates hashed filenames for JS, CSS, and chunk assets
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

